<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 01:30:02 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>取消伊朗袭击后，特朗普表示谈判将于周一下午恢复，而德黑兰将继续与阿曼进行霍尔木兹谈判</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/iran-war-trump-negotiations-resume-monday-tehran-hormuz-talks-oman/</link><description>特朗普周日表示，他预计谈判将“明天下午”恢复，但没有详细说明谁将参与此类谈判。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26214804419643-e1785712620486.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 23:23:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/iran-war-trump-negotiations-resume-monday-tehran-hormuz-talks-oman/</guid></item><item><title>市场信号表明，在科斯皮指数创纪录飙升之后，投资者再次回到买入模式，而特朗普最近的伊朗逆转给了和平机会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/kospi-index-dow-futures-us-stocks-trump-iran-war-reversal-oil-prices/</link><description>最近一直是全球股市领头羊的韩国综合股价指数周五飙升 18%，创下有记录以来的最大单日涨幅。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287719062-e1785708008260.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 22:59:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/kospi-index-dow-futures-us-stocks-trump-iran-war-reversal-oil-prices/</guid></item><item><title>英国伯纳姆承诺“不懈”关注非法移民</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/uk-prime-minister-any-burnham-relentless-focus-illegal-immigration-ceuta-spain-morocco/</link><description>“公众不喜欢边境看起来不受控制的想法。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288018264-e1785706918628.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 21:46:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/uk-prime-minister-any-burnham-relentless-focus-illegal-immigration-ceuta-spain-morocco/</guid></item><item><title>以下是特朗普在整个伊朗战争期间断断续续的打击方式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/trump-on-again-off-again-strikes-iran-war-oil-prices-ceasefire-mou-hormuz/</link><description>突然的转变是这场持续五个月的冲突的一个决定性特征，这场冲突导致石油和基本商品价格飙升。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26212762521698_1e9a34-e1785706274801.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 21:35:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/trump-on-again-off-again-strikes-iran-war-oil-prices-ceasefire-mou-hormuz/</guid></item><item><title>长鑫存储的重磅IPO将考验中国存储器制造商是否已准备好成为众人瞩目的焦点：“这并不意味着中国正在广泛追赶”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/cxmts-blockbuster-ipo-will-test-whether-chinas-memory-makers-are-ready-for-the-spotlight-it-does-not-yet-mean-china-is-broadly-catching-up/</link><description>专家表示，短缺迫使企业寻求中国芯片供应，但采用仍可能是有选择性的，并且存在政治争议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287911689.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 21:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/cxmts-blockbuster-ipo-will-test-whether-chinas-memory-makers-are-ready-for-the-spotlight-it-does-not-yet-mean-china-is-broadly-catching-up/</guid></item><item><title>据称阿斯利康已探索合并百时美施贵宝</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/astrazeneca-bristol-myers-squibb-merger-patents-us-market/</link><description>市值达1330亿美元的百时美施贵宝可以为阿斯利康在美国市场提供更大的立足点。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2242162839-e1785704467995.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 21:27:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/astrazeneca-bristol-myers-squibb-merger-patents-us-market/</guid></item><item><title>Indeed 称，人工智能正在英国创造双速就业市场</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/ai-two-speed-job-market-uk-software-manufacturing-experience-entry-level/</link><description>“需求集中在与人工智能直接相关的经验丰富的工人和角色，而不是均匀地流经整个行业。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2254188085-e1785703955883.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 20:58:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/ai-two-speed-job-market-uk-software-manufacturing-experience-entry-level/</guid></item><item><title>随着人工智能创造更多的企业家和技能不匹配，Z 世代面临着成为专家还是“通用书呆子”的选择</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/as-ai-creates-more-entrepreneurs-and-a-skills-mismatch-gen-z-faces-the-choice-of-being-a-specialist-or-a-general-purpose-nerd/</link><description>“随着公司积极用专业人才取代通才，人工智能正在造成结构性技能不匹配。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2169143052-e1785697007455.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 20:27:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/as-ai-creates-more-entrepreneurs-and-a-skills-mismatch-gen-z-faces-the-choice-of-being-a-specialist-or-a-general-purpose-nerd/</guid></item><item><title>他 16 岁时无家可归。现在，他是大卫·贝克汉姆 (David Beckham) 健康公司的董事会成员，他的公司收入即将达到 10 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/hudson-leogrande-comfrt-homeless-16-david-beckham-board-business-1-billion-revenue/</link><description>Hudson Leogrande 是流行连帽衫品牌 Comfrt 的创始人，在迈向企业家之路之前，曾在汽车销售和烟囱电话营销之间徘徊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HudsonLeogrande-1-e1785527678167.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/hudson-leogrande-comfrt-homeless-16-david-beckham-board-business-1-billion-revenue/</guid></item><item><title>参议员伯尼·莫雷诺表示众议员马克斯·米勒不应该在众议院任职，称前女婿“对我女儿和孙女构成威胁”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/sen-bernie-moreno-rep-max-miller-former-son-in-law-domestic-abuse-allegations/</link><description>艾米丽·莫雷诺表示，米勒在他们结婚时烫伤、殴打并威胁了她。米勒否认了这些指控。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26213505987207-e1785693715342.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 18:12:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/sen-bernie-moreno-rep-max-miller-former-son-in-law-domestic-abuse-allegations/</guid></item></channel></rss>